TablePilot is an independent modified desktop edition. It removes AI/MCP
runtime integration and the upstream app updater, changes application and
credential-store identity, and supplies its own Windows/Linux build workflow.
It is not an official DBX release. See FORK_CHANGES.md for the modification list.
